-east with an orchestrator error, leaving a mixed fleet. I retried, and the second attempt rolled out v2.3.0 to all three regions successfully.\n- **Verification:** checkout-api now reports `healthy: true` on v2.3.0 everywhere, error rate down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for checkout-api describing the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), and recommending v2.3.1 be investigated before redeploy. The create call timed out but I confirmed via the incident list that it was created exactly once, so I did not retry.\n\n**Follow-ups worth noting:** the orchestrator error during the first rollback attempt is unexplained and may deserve its own look, and v2.3.1 shouldn't be redeployed until the root cause is understood.", "type": "text"}]}]}